    {
      "id": "p0068-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Translators usually work with ordinary text that can be typed into a computer. But when it comes to games, anime, and other forms of entertainment, visual displays also need to be properly translated. Undertale was no exception - dozens of images and animations needed to be redrawn for the Japanese release.",
        "raw": "Translators usually work with ordinary text that can be typed into a computer.\nBut when it comes to games, anime, and other forms of entertainment, visual\ndisplays also need to be properly translated. Undertale was no exception -\ndozens of images and animations needed to be redrawn for the Japanese release.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29222822,
          0.09438571,
          0.89746172,
          0.16087857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29019921,
          0.09367143,
          0.90468499,
          0.16195
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "译者通常处理可以输入电脑的普通文字。但游戏、动画等娱乐作品中的视觉内容，也需要妥善翻译。Undertale 也不例外：日语版需要重绘数十张图像和动画。",
        "status": "draft",
