    {
      "id": "p0068-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Image translation adds a new dimension to the localization process - after all, professional translators aren't necessarily professional artists. With this in mind, 8-4 teamed up with Toby and 256graph, a Japanese studio that specializes in pixel art, to localize the English text images into Japanese.",
        "raw": "Image translation adds a new dimension to the localization process - after\nall, professional translators aren't necessarily professional artists. With this\nin mind, 8-4 teamed up with Toby and 256graph, a Japanese studio that\nspecializes in pixel art, to localize the English text images into Japanese.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2936891,
          0.38744286,
          0.87170343,
          0.45391429
